    "created_at": "2020-01-23T21:11:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-23T21:11:22Z",
    "body": "This is tested in http://wpt.live/html/rendering/widgets/button-layout/inline-level.html with the assumption that the linebreak is preserved.\r\n\r\nChromium bug https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=922011\r\n\r\nQuick live dom viewer demo for `getComputedStyle(input).whiteSpace` for different `type`s and different `appearance`\r\n\r\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/7709\r\n\r\nIn WebKit/Chromium/Gecko, `white-space` is `pre` for `submit`, `reset` and `button`. In Gecko it's `nowrap` for `file`. All others are `normal`. Not affected by `-webkit-appearance: none`.",
